VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'your glasses will be able to work with one cable. Underneath the glasses lies a nice light-blocking pad, with a cool carbon fiber design on the front; It feels soft to the touch, like silicone or rubber. It seems like it will do a great job of'

[01:27] [scene:talk]
